<!-- HISTORY -->

<section id="history">

<h2>History of Kerala</h2>

<p>

Kerala has a history stretching back over 3000 years.
Ancient spice trade connected Kerala with Rome, Arabia and China.

The Chera Dynasty ruled much of Kerala before the arrival of the Portuguese in 1498.

Later came Dutch and British influence before Kerala became a state of India on
1 November 1956.

</p>

